  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Slope of the line $\\mathrm{QM}$ is $\\tan \\frac{2 \\pi}{3}=-\\sqrt{3}$ \nHence equation is line $\\mathrm{QM}$ is $y=-\\sqrt{3} \\mathrm{x}$.\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6YEnjqs18LyDT4JHjdnLBb3H8g9MdRi0HllhMQ30C9o.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
